      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，多么美妙的个人秀啊！那道\n连世纪末霸王的双眼都要灼伤的光芒……简直\n就是戏剧界的明日之星！Bravo────！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f08d6a1f059272a1f5db626b5003d4780d3d55448c0e6184e919dc1fa6d405",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
